    "created_at": "2015-09-28T15:26:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-28T15:26:59Z",
    "body": "There's a bigger issue here of documenting how e.g. `navigator.vendor` depends on the other values. `taintEnabled()` has the same issue, but there the method shouldn't be exposed at all by non-Gecko browsers, so that can't be expressed with prose.\n\n(For these purposes I think we have 3 classes of user agents left: Gecko, WebKit, and Chromium.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
