    "created_at": "2015-09-28T17:10:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-28T17:10:26Z",
    "body": "Yeah, however, how is that not going to be a slippery slope? Will we avoid using it outside the legacy `Navigator` stuff?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/143806808/reactions",
