    "created_at": "2015-09-29T08:49:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-29T08:49:32Z",
    "body": "I think you should define a concept of sorts. Maybe \"navigator compatibility mode\"? And that mode is one of Gecko/WebKit/Chromium. And then for each feature affected by this, we branch on that mode. I think this is basically what @zcorpan suggested, but a tad more explicit.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
